      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of feeling that way is immense, and the loneliness you describe is a heavy burden to carry. It is easy to feel that all effort is futile when the system seems rigged against integrity. Sometimes, the fight isn't about fixing the whole massive system, but about finding a small, private space where you can hold onto your own values. Remember that your own sense of self and your inherent worth are not dependent on the approval or success of that broken world.",
      "source": "target",
